  "details": "Right now they have so much unnecessary space for it to be used and a easy fix would just be pushing down the bar and the username down so the Group banner can be more seen, I see this becoming more of an issue when it releases, especially in Club worlds because right now imagine seeing all the nameplates, \"Oh turn them off!\", It's not even just that when you open up your menu to see all the HUDs to see a username you want, Your going to be getting an absolute eyesore of a bunch of colors which isn't ideal for people who easily get headaches like myself.\n\nIt just needs these adjustments and its perfectly fine, Right now it feels its just too cluttered\n\nMinimalist is just best for a 3D Space, Please.",
